          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Research project on Dead Sea: Why is there no aquatic life in the Dead Sea? Try to find out if there are any other similar water bodies."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.341,
            0.397,
            0.744,
            0.49
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Investigate how well common salt dissolves in different solvents, such as water, vinegar, and oil. Compare the solubility of salt in each solvent and record your observations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 10,
